Subject: [PATCH v19 01/27] x86/cpufeatures: Add Intel-defined SGX feature bit
Date:   Sun, 17 Mar 2019 23:14:30 +0200
Message-Id: <20190317211456.13927-2-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
In-Reply-To: <20190317211456.13927-1-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
References: <20190317211456.13927-1-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
Sender: linux-sgx-owner@vger.kernel.org
Precedence: bulk
